# Text Claude must not write (enforced by hooks/style-guard.sh right after each edit).
# Format: <extended regex> :: <message shown to Claude>
# Only the newly written text is checked, so existing files are not flagged.

— :: No em dashes. Use a period, comma, colon or parentheses instead.

# More examples (remove the leading # to enable):
# console\.log\( :: Use the project logger instead of console.log.
# \b(TODO|FIXME)\b :: Do not leave TODO or FIXME. Finish it or tell the user.
# \b(delve|seamless|leverage|robust)\b :: Plain words, please. Rewrite without this filler term.
